{"unit_id":"tag:0347:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n经常可以证明，一个概形（scheme）的覆盖（covering）的各个成员具有某种性质（property）。在许多情形下，这意味着该概形（scheme）也具有这一性质（property）。例如，若<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme），且<MATH_0002>是满射（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphism），使得<MATH_0003>是既约（reduced）概形（scheme），则<MATH_0004>是既约的（reduced）。通过考察局部环（local rings）并使用《代数（Algebra）》一章引理<REF_0001>，可以证明这一点。我们称既约（reduced）这一性质（property）<TEXTITOPEN_0001>经平坦满射态射下降（descends through flat surjective morphisms）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>。这类结果中的一些汇集在《代数（Algebra）》一章第<REF_0002>节中；对于概形（schemes），则汇集在第<REF_0003>节中。有关态射（morphisms）的性质（properties）下降的一些类似结果见第<REF_0004>节。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n另一方面，存在满射（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）<MATH_0005>，其中<MATH_0006>既约（reduced）而<MATH_0007>不既约，例如态射（morphism）<MATH_0008>。因此，既约（reduced）这一性质（property）并不<TEXTITOPEN_0002>沿平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）上升（ascend）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>。剩余域（residue fields）无限（infinite）这一性质（property）则确实沿平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）上升（ascend）（当然，它不沿满射（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）下降（descend））。这类结果中的一些汇集在《代数（Algebra）》一章第<REF_0005>节中。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n最后，我们称一个性质（property）<TEXTITOPEN_0003>对平坦拓扑是局部的（local for the flat topology）<TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，如果它沿平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）上升（ascends），并沿平坦（flat）满射（surjective）态射（morphisms）下降（descends）。一个有些平凡的例子是剩余域（residue fields）具有给定特征（characteristic）这一性质（property）。为更精确地表述，并将其与概形（schemes）上的各种拓扑（topologies）联系起来，我们给出以下形式定义。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"既约"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"既约的"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"既约"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"descends through flat surjective morphisms","target_term":"经平坦满射态射下降"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"properties","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"既约"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"既约"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ascend","target_term":"上升"},{"source_term":"residue fields","target_term":"剩余域"},{"source_term":"infinite","target_term":"无限"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ascend","target_term":"上升"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"descend","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"local for the flat topology","target_term":"对平坦拓扑是局部的"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"ascends","target_term":"上升"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"descends","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"residue fields","target_term":"剩余域"},{"source_term":"characteristic","target_term":"特征"},{"source_term":"property","target_term":"性质"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"sour